		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "6483fccf-f21f-4a49-b336-3d07c9afc25f")
		(at 152.13 96.62 180)
		(descr "LinkMems LMA2718B381-OA7 (C5373222), analog bottom-port MEMS mic, SMD-4P 2.8x1.9mm. Land pattern per LinkMems LMA2718B381 datasheet section 7.1: pads 1=OUT 2=GND 3=VDD, 0.35/0.30/0.35 x 0.55mm, 0.625mm pitch (1.60 span); pad4=GND annular ring OD1.45/ID0.95; acoustic port (NPTH) Ø0.35 at ring centre (enlarged from datasheet Ø0.25 for manufacturability; still 0.30mm clear of the ring ID); 1.20mm from the pads' inner edge to the ring centre (datasheet 6.2: 0.55 + 1.20 + 0.875 of the 2.75 length), so 1.475 centre to centre; origin at the package centre: pads at y -0.975, ring and port at +0.500. No GND bridge (datasheet-faithful) - tie pad2 to pad4/pour on the board.")
